# Coldscholar Dictionary house overrides (R102, D265 ruling 3): CC-CEDICT-format lines that
# replace the pinned snapshot's record of the same key (dictionary/source/MANIFEST.md,
# 80a3b2c91524...). The key must exist in the snapshot; only the glosses change.
# Author: the house. Every line is assistant-written (Claude Opus 5.5) from the snapshot lines it
# re-points; that is assistant adjudication, not human review. house-overrides-why.tsv, beside
# this file, gives each line's sources and the ruling.
# Licence: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), the dataset's own,
# published with it. An override never feeds the trad->simp conversion table.
# The file only grows (D255): a later version appends, and each earlier version stays frozen,
# byte for byte, in history/ for the batches built on it.
#! version=1
#! format=ts
#! charset=UTF-8
#! entries=8
#! publisher=Coldscholar Dictionary (house)
誒 诶 [ei1] /hey (used to draw attention)/
誒 诶 [ei2] /eh; huh (used to express surprise)/
誒 诶 [ei3] /hmm (used to express disapproval)/
誒 诶 [ei4] /yes (used to express agreement)/
欸 欸 [ei1] /variant of 誒|诶[ei1]/
欸 欸 [ei2] /variant of 誒|诶[ei2]/
欸 欸 [ei3] /variant of 誒|诶[ei3]/
